---
import { Scale, ShieldCheck, Factory, FileCheck } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="tentang-kami" class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8 sm:mb-12 lg:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-3">
        Presisi Pencampuran & Integritas Mutu Beton
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        CV Anugerah Mecca Sejahtera melayani kebutuhan pasokan beton cor siap pakai dengan proses penakaran material terkontrol untuk menjaga konsistensi mutu pada setiap pengiriman.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative">
        <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 group">
          <img 
            src="/images/fleet-batching-plant.jpg" 
            alt="Ilustrasi Fasilitas Batching Plant Beton Ready Mix" 
            class="w-full h-56 sm:h-72 lg:h-[460px] object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 sm:bottom-6 sm:left-6 sm:right-6 p-3 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/90 text-white border border-white/10">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-safety-400 block mb-1">
              Sistem Penakaran Terkontrol
            </span>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Penimbangan agregat pasir, semen, split, dan air secara mekanis terkalibrasi membantu menjaga konsistensi campuran acuan SNI.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          Pengecoran manual sering menghadapi kendala rasio air-semen tidak konsisten dan penurunan kekuatan tekan. AMS Beton hadir memberikan kepastian mutu dan volume riil melalui formulasi batching plant otomatis.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <Scale class="w-5 h-5 text-safety-600 mb-2" />
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Timbangan Terkalibrasi</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Load-cell akurasi tinggi dengan toleransi di bawah 1%.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <FileCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-safety-600 mb-2" />
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Surat Jalan Resmi</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Volume kubikasi riil dan slump tercatat transparan.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <ShieldCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-safety-600 mb-2" />
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Badan Hukum Resmi</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              CV berbadan hukum resmi dengan NIB dan faktur pajak PKP.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <Factory class="w-5 h-5 text-safety-600 mb-2" />
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Add-On Khusus</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Admixture retarder, accelerator, dan waterproofing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a 
          href="#mutu-beton" 
          class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1 text-sm font-bold text-safety-600 hover:text-safety-700 transition-colors"
        >
          <span>Lihat Katalog Mutu Beton &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
